<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZCC clears Alliance to acquire Feltex assets.</title>
<headline>NZCC clears Alliance to acquire Feltex assets.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand's anti-monopolies watchdog the Commerce Commission said on Tuesday it had cleared Alliance Textiles NZ Ltd to acquire the Feltex yarn business and assets owned by BTR Operations NZ Ltd.</p>
<p>Alliance was not acquiring the Feltex carpet business also owned by BTR. This had been sold to another purchaser.</p>
<p>The commission said in a statement that Alliance acquiring the Feltex yarn plants in Wainuiomata and Kakaraki would not result in it acquiring or strengthening a dominant position in any market.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
